<title>USA: Roosevelt Fin'l Group Inc Q4 loss vs net.</title>
<headline>Roosevelt Fin'l Group Inc Q4 loss vs net.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted loss	 $0.76   profit	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net loss		  32.139   profit	15,916</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	43,691		   45,655</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 operating earnings were reduced by about $52 million after-tax by the recognition of previously deferred expenses related to terminated interest rate exchange agreements.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr diluted profit     $0.13   profit	 $0.56</p>
<p> Net profit		 9,962   profit	27,098</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	42,732		   40,629</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 results were reduced by about $18 million after-tax because of a charge for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization.</p>
<p>Assets $7.8 billion vs $9.0 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $5.35 billion vs $4.91 billion</p>
<p>Loans $4.3 billion vs $3.58 billion</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
